{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 1668805528835160651,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Debugging the compiler",
      "source_hash": 909403071051705729,
      "context_hash": 4812500003763322408,
      "translation": "컴파일러 디버깅",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "compiler": "컴파일러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:47.695997Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "This chapter contains a few tips to debug the compiler.",
      "source_hash": 9510809935163964818,
      "context_hash": 8870185718331646495,
      "translation": "이 장에서는 컴파일러를 디버깅하는 몇 가지 팁을 다룹니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "compiler": "컴파일러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:47.695999Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "These tips aim to be useful no matter what you are working on.",
      "source_hash": 6769839462324465940,
      "context_hash": 7734261204314126833,
      "translation": "이 팁들은 여러분이 어떤 작업을 하고 있든 유용하도록 작성되었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:47.695999Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "Some of the other chapters have advice about specific parts of the compiler (e.g. the [Queries Debugging and Testing chapter](./incrcomp-debugging.md) or the [LLVM Debugging chapter](./backend/debugging.md)).",
      "source_hash": 13552163769793655760,
      "context_hash": 3187966199050005501,
      "translation": "다른 몇몇 장에서는 컴파일러의 특정 부분에 대한 조언을 다루고 있습니다(예: [쿼리 디버깅 및 테스트 장](./incrcomp-debugging.md) 또는 [LLVM 디버깅 장](./backend/debugging.md)).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "compiler": "컴파일러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:47.696Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Configuring the compiler",
      "source_hash": 15420682008283533708,
      "context_hash": 5109027170246676698,
      "translation": "컴파일러 설정하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "compiler": "컴파일러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:47.696Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "By default, rustc is built without most debug information.",
      "source_hash": 6575653321416380173,
      "context_hash": 15732464905887019617,
      "translation": "기본적으로 rustc는 대부분의 디버그 정보 없이 빌드됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:47.696Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "To enable debug info, set `rust.debug = true` in your bootstrap.toml.",
      "source_hash": 10522166686079467368,
      "context_hash": 107623522738054137,
      "translation": "디버그 정보를 활성화하려면 bootstrap.toml에서 `rust.debug = true`로 설정하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:47.696001Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Setting `rust.debug = true` turns on many different debug options (e.g., `debug-assertions`, `debug-logging`, etc.) which can be individually tweaked if you want to, but many people simply set `rust.debug = true`.",
      "source_hash": 9621302308498939001,
      "context_hash": 8456720352592787513,
      "translation": "`rust.debug = true`를 설정하면 여러 디버그 옵션(예: `debug-assertions`, `debug-logging` 등)이 활성화되며, 원한다면 개별적으로 조정할 수도 있지만 많은 사람들은 그냥 `rust.debug = true`만 설정합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:47.696001Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "If you want to use GDB to debug rustc, please set `bootstrap.toml` with options:",
      "source_hash": 101101496499401480,
      "context_hash": 5377358820742477274,
      "translation": "GDB를 사용해 rustc를 디버깅하고 싶다면, 다음 옵션으로 `bootstrap.toml`을 설정하십시오:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:21:04.314139Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "NOTE: This will use a lot of disk space (upwards of",
      "source_hash": 13285111551963182548,
      "context_hash": 5237741018421818685,
      "translation": "참고: 이 방법은 디스크 공간을 많이 사용합니다 (최대",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:21:04.314139Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "35GB), and will take a lot more compile time.",
      "source_hash": 5865572119669401314,
      "context_hash": 585594924275551862,
      "translation": "35GB까지), 그리고 컴파일 시간도 훨씬 더 오래 걸립니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:21:04.314139Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:1",
      "source": "With `debuginfo-level = 1` (the default when `debug = true`), you will be able to track the execution path, but will lose the symbol information for debugging.",
      "source_hash": 16066558253865424259,
      "context_hash": 6393294139571373284,
      "translation": "`debuginfo-level = 1`(이는 `debug = true`일 때의 기본값입니다)을 사용하면 실행 경로는 추적할 수 있지만, 디버깅을 위한 심벌 정보는 잃게 됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:21:04.314140Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "The default configuration will enable `symbol-mangling-version` v0.",
      "source_hash": 23158668564384100,
      "context_hash": 8999221619884272520,
      "translation": "기본 설정에서는 `symbol-mangling-version` v0가 활성화됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:47.696002Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:7/seg:1",
      "source": "This requires at least GDB v10.2, otherwise you need to disable new symbol-mangling-version in `bootstrap.toml`.",
      "source_hash": 260553343626039661,
      "context_hash": 14499358365877629012,
      "translation": "이는 최소 GDB v10.2를 필요로 하며, 그렇지 않다면 `bootstrap.toml`에서 새로운 symbol-mangling-version을 비활성화해야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:47.696003Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "See the comments in `bootstrap.example.toml` for more info.",
      "source_hash": 9609128017604771654,
      "context_hash": 5670644674692605111,
      "translation": "더 자세한 정보는 `bootstrap.example.toml`의 주석을 참고하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:47.696003Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "You will need to rebuild the compiler after changing any configuration option.",
      "source_hash": 2649636504466999777,
      "context_hash": 2510621454104873975,
      "translation": "설정 옵션을 변경한 후에는 컴파일러를 다시 빌드해야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "compiler": "컴파일러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:47.696003Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Suppressing the ICE file",
      "source_hash": 4230185473629704270,
      "context_hash": 15774654189696357379,
      "translation": "ICE 파일 생성 억제하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:47.696003Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "By default, if rustc encounters an Internal Compiler Error (ICE) it will dump the ICE contents to an ICE file within the current working directory named `rustc-ice-<timestamp>-<pid>.txt`.",
      "source_hash": 8650883740041363205,
      "context_hash": 164660922392242900,
      "translation": "기본적으로 rustc가 내부 컴파일러 오류(ICE)를 만나면 현재 작업 디렉터리에 `rustc-ice-<timestamp>-<pid>.txt`라는 이름의 ICE 파일로 ICE 내용을 덤프합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "compiler": "컴파일러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:47.696003Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "If this is not desirable, you can prevent the ICE file from being created with `RUSTC_ICE=0`.",
      "source_hash": 4584443574154193302,
      "context_hash": 4667914713988660420,
      "translation": "이를 원하지 않는다면 `RUSTC_ICE=0`으로 설정하여 ICE 파일이 생성되지 않도록 할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:47.696004Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Getting a backtrace",
      "source_hash": 14681138668250966729,
      "context_hash": 11711882620001882517,
      "translation": "백트레이스 얻기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:47.696004Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "When you have an ICE (panic in the compiler), you can set `RUST_BACKTRACE=1` to get the stack trace of the `panic!` like in normal Rust programs.",
      "source_hash": 3796867661738097943,
      "context_hash": 14525041104827628566,
      "translation": "ICE(컴파일러 내에서의 패닉)가 발생했을 때, 일반적인 Rust 프로그램에서와 마찬가지로 `RUST_BACKTRACE=1`을 설정하면 `panic!`의 스택 트레이스를 얻을 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "compiler": "컴파일러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:47.696004Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "IIRC backtraces **don't work** on MinGW, sorry.",
      "source_hash": 4490558619209379667,
      "context_hash": 16240236712061418756,
      "translation": "기억하기로는 백트레이스가 MinGW에서는 **작동하지 않습니다**, 죄송합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:47.696004Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "If you have trouble or the backtraces are full of `unknown`, you might want to find some way to use Linux, Mac, or MSVC on Windows.",
      "source_hash": 15584084442015692107,
      "context_hash": 11311906313363593654,
      "translation": "문제가 있거나 백트레이스가 `unknown`으로 가득 차 있다면, Windows에서 Linux, Mac, 또는 MSVC를 사용할 방법을 찾는 것이 좋습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:47.696005Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "In the default configuration (without `debug` set to `true`), you don't have line numbers enabled, so the backtrace looks like this:",
      "source_hash": 5262565121223344772,
      "context_hash": 2120857366767683879,
      "translation": "기본 설정(`debug`가 `true`로 설정되지 않은 상태)에서는 줄 번호가 활성화되어 있지 않으므로, 백트레이스는 다음과 같이 보입니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:47.696005Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "If you set `debug = true`, you will get line numbers for the stack trace.",
      "source_hash": 10100027313721131501,
      "context_hash": 16008087091173778824,
      "translation": "`debug = true`로 설정하면 스택 트레이스에 줄 번호가 표시됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:47.696005Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "Then the backtrace will look like this:",
      "source_hash": 17987262536594165911,
      "context_hash": 49861102393870831,
      "translation": "그러면 백트레이스는 다음과 같이 보일 것입니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:47.696005Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "`-Z` flags",
      "source_hash": 13785967022044538442,
      "context_hash": 6966937245607132649,
      "translation": "`-Z` 플래그",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:47.696005Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The compiler has a bunch of `-Z *` flags.",
      "source_hash": 4672047668740893073,
      "context_hash": 7080438744908721348,
      "translation": "컴파일러에는 다양한 `-Z *` 플래그가 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "compiler": "컴파일러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:47.696006Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "These are unstable flags that are only enabled on nightly.",
      "source_hash": 9427835339977762428,
      "context_hash": 1410790342377190469,
      "translation": "이들은 나이틀리에서만 활성화되는 불안정한 플래그입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:47.696006Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "Many of them are useful for debugging.",
      "source_hash": 16037656286190762777,
      "context_hash": 4118023342670147311,
      "translation": "이 중 다수는 디버깅에 유용합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:47.696007Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:3",
      "source": "To get a full listing of `-Z` flags, use `-Z help`.",
      "source_hash": 10044445708963546926,
      "context_hash": 16042216593450859992,
      "translation": "`-Z` 플래그의 전체 목록을 확인하려면 `-Z help`를 사용하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:47.696007Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "One useful flag is `-Z verbose-internals`, which generally enables printing more info that could be useful for debugging.",
      "source_hash": 6843306898745507448,
      "context_hash": 12033039207248419442,
      "translation": "유용한 플래그 중 하나는 `-Z verbose-internals`로, 일반적으로 디버깅에 유용할 수 있는 더 많은 정보를 출력하도록 활성화합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:47.696007Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Right below you can find elaborate explainers on a selected few.",
      "source_hash": 13591548037985897260,
      "context_hash": 16047108937713297229,
      "translation": "바로 아래에서 선택된 몇 가지에 대한 상세한 설명을 확인할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:47.696007Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Getting a backtrace for errors",
      "source_hash": 6197548893538030893,
      "context_hash": 5679216065005638009,
      "translation": "오류에 대한 백트레이스 얻기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:57.368049Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "If you want to get a backtrace to the point where the compiler emits an error message, you can pass the `-Z treat-err-as-bug=n`, which will make the compiler panic on the `nth` error.",
      "source_hash": 8185953213079080073,
      "context_hash": 13780996686520168335,
      "translation": "컴파일러가 오류 메시지를 발생시키는 지점까지의 백트레이스를 얻고 싶다면, `-Z treat-err-as-bug=n`을 전달할 수 있으며, 이렇게 하면 컴파일러가 `n`번째 오류에서 패닉을 일으킵니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "compiler": "컴파일러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:57.368049Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:5/seg:1",
      "source": "If you leave off `=n`, the compiler will assume `1` for `n` and thus panic on the first error it encounters.",
      "source_hash": 14774080214567586805,
      "context_hash": 12470998902607129782,
      "translation": "`=n`을 생략하면 컴파일러는 `n`을 `1`로 간주하여 처음 만나는 오류에서 패닉을 일으킵니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "compiler": "컴파일러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:57.368049Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "For example:",
      "source_hash": 4114854479619665730,
      "context_hash": 4366337841368115806,
      "translation": "예를 들면:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:57.368049Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "Now, where does the error above come from?",
      "source_hash": 11630143123237203987,
      "context_hash": 13318797847039200270,
      "translation": "자, 위의 오류는 어디에서 비롯된 것일까요?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:57.368049Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "Cool, now I have a backtrace for the error!",
      "source_hash": 1071147281636556002,
      "context_hash": 5352033474377500473,
      "translation": "좋습니다, 이제 해당 오류에 대한 백트레이스를 얻었습니다!",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:57.368049Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:13/seg:0",
      "source": "Debugging delayed bugs",
      "source_hash": 18167019313293862839,
      "context_hash": 1925978591550081206,
      "translation": "지연된 버그 디버깅하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:57.368049Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:14/seg:0",
      "source": "The `-Z eagerly-emit-delayed-bugs` option makes it easy to debug delayed bugs.",
      "source_hash": 4725556155699311280,
      "context_hash": 94680193346146547,
      "translation": "`-Z eagerly-emit-delayed-bugs` 옵션은 지연된 버그를 쉽게 디버깅할 수 있게 해줍니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:57.368050Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:14/seg:1",
      "source": "It turns them into normal errors, i.e. makes them visible.",
      "source_hash": 14007241663436871624,
      "context_hash": 13652169810876995984,
      "translation": "이 옵션은 지연된 버그를 일반 오류로 바꿔서, 즉 눈에 보이도록 만듭니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:57.368050Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:14/seg:2",
      "source": "This can be used in combination with `-Z treat-err-as-bug` to stop at a particular delayed bug and get a backtrace.",
      "source_hash": 10796422630122514866,
      "context_hash": 18250434677918963870,
      "translation": "이는 `-Z treat-err-as-bug`와 함께 사용하여 특정 지연된 버그에서 멈추고 백트레이스를 얻는 데 사용할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:57.368050Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:15/seg:0",
      "source": "Getting the error creation location",
      "source_hash": 3307705822427565826,
      "context_hash": 13621018705383850044,
      "translation": "오류 생성 위치 얻기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:57.368050Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:16/seg:0",
      "source": "`-Z track-diagnostics` can help figure out where errors are emitted.",
      "source_hash": 14464546365602956293,
      "context_hash": 2612229552778163894,
      "translation": "`-Z track-diagnostics`는 오류가 어디에서 발생하는지 파악하는 데 도움이 됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:57.368050Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:16/seg:1",
      "source": "It uses `#[track_caller]` for this and prints its location alongside the error:",
      "source_hash": 6206651194746530430,
      "context_hash": 10980818463582817828,
      "translation": "이를 위해 `#[track_caller]`를 사용하며, 오류와 함께 해당 위치를 출력합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:57.368050Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:18/seg:0",
      "source": "This is similar but different to `-Z treat-err-as-bug`:",
      "source_hash": 7995998379354892383,
      "context_hash": 7751520999079479416,
      "translation": "이는 `-Z treat-err-as-bug`와 비슷하지만 다릅니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:57.368050Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:19/seg:0",
      "source": "it will print the locations for all errors emitted",
      "source_hash": 1225668410050385550,
      "context_hash": 7971597058614258032,
      "translation": "발생한 모든 오류의 위치를 출력합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:57.368050Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:20/seg:0",
      "source": "it does not require a compiler built with debug symbols",
      "source_hash": 10919970051799317606,
      "context_hash": 2341554267176644404,
      "translation": "디버그 심벌이 포함되어 빌드된 컴파일러가 필요하지 않습니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "compiler": "컴파일러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:57.368050Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:21/seg:0",
      "source": "you don't have to read through a big stack trace.",
      "source_hash": 3948664102518297976,
      "context_hash": 12898780337327187481,
      "translation": "긴 스택 트레이스를 처음부터 끝까지 읽을 필요가 없습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:57.368050Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Getting logging output",
      "source_hash": 6838511996142025749,
      "context_hash": 2360435453393185903,
      "translation": "로깅 출력 얻기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:57.368050Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The compiler uses the [`tracing`] crate for logging.",
      "source_hash": 3477560801439702565,
      "context_hash": 16108988547190304590,
      "translation": "컴파일러는 로깅을 위해 [`tracing`] 크레이트를 사용합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "compiler": "컴파일러",
        "crate": "크레이트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:57.368050Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "For details, see [the chapter on tracing](./tracing.md).",
      "source_hash": 16984448840450544605,
      "context_hash": 17589288481250793452,
      "translation": "자세한 내용은 [tracing에 관한 장](./tracing.md)을 참고하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:57.368051Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Narrowing (bisecting) regressions",
      "source_hash": 7338521655086649760,
      "context_hash": 12958325135309467831,
      "translation": "회귀 범위 좁히기 (이분 탐색)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:57.368051Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The [cargo-bisect-rustc][bisect] tool can be used as a quick and easy way to find exactly which PR caused a change in `rustc` behavior.",
      "source_hash": 6862866302581635296,
      "context_hash": 13165342692749756397,
      "translation": "[cargo-bisect-rustc][bisect] 도구는 정확히 어떤 PR이 `rustc`의 동작 변화를 일으켰는지 찾는 빠르고 쉬운 방법으로 사용할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:57.368051Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "It automatically downloads `rustc` PR artifacts and tests them against a project you provide until it finds the regression.",
      "source_hash": 9753318328858524616,
      "context_hash": 1008693689572746261,
      "translation": "이 도구는 회귀를 찾을 때까지 `rustc` PR 산출물을 자동으로 다운로드하여 사용자가 제공한 프로젝트에 대해 테스트합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:57.368051Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "You can then look at the PR to get more context on *why* it was changed.",
      "source_hash": 16150785550137546944,
      "context_hash": 1345832463010194321,
      "translation": "그런 다음 해당 PR을 살펴보면 *왜* 변경되었는지에 대한 더 많은 맥락을 얻을 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:57.368051Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:3",
      "source": "See [this tutorial][bisect-tutorial] on how to use it.",
      "source_hash": 1877828471795024838,
      "context_hash": 4936616660286126271,
      "translation": "사용 방법에 대해서는 [이 튜토리얼][bisect-tutorial]을 참고하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:57.368051Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Downloading artifacts from Rust's CI",
      "source_hash": 1635367471019520831,
      "context_hash": 9541589801207844032,
      "translation": "Rust의 CI에서 산출물 다운로드하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:57.368051Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The [rustup-toolchain-install-master][rtim] tool by kennytm can be used to download the artifacts produced by Rust's CI for a specific SHA1 -- this basically corresponds to the successful landing of some PR -- and then sets them up for your local use.",
      "source_hash": 11341788159144478776,
      "context_hash": 17430037738567054120,
      "translation": "kennytm이 만든 [rustup-toolchain-install-master][rtim] 도구를 사용하면 특정 SHA1에 대해 Rust의 CI가 생성한 산출물—이는 기본적으로 어떤 PR이 성공적으로 반영된 것에 해당합니다—을 다운로드하여 로컬에서 사용할 수 있도록 설정할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:57.368051Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "This also works for artifacts produced by `@bors try`.",
      "source_hash": 18090949139344757580,
      "context_hash": 3800903031610274752,
      "translation": "이는 `@bors try`로 생성된 산출물에도 동일하게 적용됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:57.368051Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "This is helpful when you want to examine the resulting build of a PR without doing the build yourself.",
      "source_hash": 15421823803914665923,
      "context_hash": 12291089217562106904,
      "translation": "이는 직접 빌드하지 않고도 PR의 결과 빌드를 살펴보고 싶을 때 유용합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:57.368051Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "`#[rustc_*]` TEST attributes",
      "source_hash": 13905384622468013966,
      "context_hash": 17602126506639873310,
      "translation": "`#[rustc_*]` TEST 속성",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:57.368051Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The compiler defines a whole lot of internal (perma-unstable) attributes some of which are useful for debugging by dumping extra compiler-internal information.",
      "source_hash": 14569656364871596911,
      "context_hash": 11311211393980725157,
      "translation": "컴파일러는 내부(영구적으로 불안정한) 속성을 다수 정의하며, 그중 일부는 컴파일러 내부의 추가 정보를 덤프하여 디버깅하는 데 유용합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "compiler": "컴파일러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:57.368051Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "These are prefixed with `rustc_` and are gated behind the internal feature `rustc_attrs` (enabled via e.g. `#![feature(rustc_attrs)]`).",
      "source_hash": 12319612585187963968,
      "context_hash": 2376947793897441772,
      "translation": "이들은 `rustc_` 접두사가 붙으며 내부 기능인 `rustc_attrs`(예: `#![feature(rustc_attrs)]`를 통해 활성화) 뒤에 게이트되어 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:57.368051Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "For a complete and up to date list, see [`builtin_attrs`].",
      "source_hash": 2083377573135193979,
      "context_hash": 11899234553623896679,
      "translation": "완전하고 최신 목록은 [`builtin_attrs`]를 참고하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:51.785572Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "More specifically, the ones marked `TEST`.",
      "source_hash": 14707830548934845937,
      "context_hash": 9146472860984758301,
      "translation": "더 구체적으로는 `TEST`로 표시된 것들입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:51.785572Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:2/seg:2",
      "source": "Here are some notable ones:",
      "source_hash": 16182053849532986523,
      "context_hash": 16415241028860465646,
      "translation": "주목할 만한 것들은 다음과 같습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:51.785572Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Attribute",
      "source_hash": 18240733926896435227,
      "context_hash": 711768646297695029,
      "translation": "속성",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:51.785572Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Description",
      "source_hash": 1758583599421982602,
      "context_hash": 5952579497619669680,
      "translation": "설명",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:51.785572Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "`rustc_dump_def_parents`",
      "source_hash": 14682172720447069153,
      "context_hash": 6530375436914008594,
      "translation": "`rustc_dump_def_parents`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:51.785573Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Dumps the chain of `DefId` parents of certain definitions.",
      "source_hash": 11689488726731126132,
      "context_hash": 17491685794077285761,
      "translation": "특정 정의의 `DefId` 부모 체인을 덤프합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:16:51.785573Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
